
(..0.99) business as usual in the Senate
(..1.99) a vague disquiet in the corridors
(..2.99) unease that no one can name
(..3.99) <span style="color: #e0745a;">a shadow over the Senate</span>
(..4.99) <span style="color: #d24a4a;">a darkness clouding every vision</span>
(4.99..) <span style="color: #b3141b;">the dark side is ascendant</span>
